                        WHY THIS LICENCE

This addon is built against Meteor Client, which is itself licensed under
the GNU General Public License v3.0. GPL-3.0 is a copyleft licence: work
derived from it has to carry the same licence. Meteor's own terms put it
plainly -- you must disclose the source of your modified work and of the
source you took from the project.

A permissive licence such as MIT would contradict that, so this project is
GPL-3.0-or-later, matching the `license` field in fabric.mod.json.

In practice this means anyone may use, study, change and share this addon,
but anything built on it must stay open under the same terms.

The full licence text is available at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
